∠1＝∠B，∠2＝∠D，∠3＝∠4＝∠C<br>且∠A＝∠A，因此四邊形甲與四邊形 ABCD 對應角相等<br>又 <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r120.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r121.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r122.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">（對應邊成比例）<br>∴四邊形甲與四邊形 ABCD 相似<br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image13.png\" width=\"104\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800292","s":"如圖(一)，P 點在 O 點正北方。一機器狗從 P 點依逆時針方向繞著 O 點作等速率圓周運動，經過 1 分鐘，其位置如圖(二)所示。若經過 101 分鐘，則機器狗的位置可用下列哪一個圖形表示？【94 年第 2 次基測】<br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image14.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"274\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image15.png\" width=\"116\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image16.png\" width=\"123\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image17.png\" width=\"111\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image18.png\" width=\"119\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":3,"e":"∵360 ÷ 45＝8<br>∴每 8 分鐘回到原出發點<br>101 ÷ 8＝12 …… 5","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800294","s":"計算<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r129.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r130.svg\" width=\"67\" alt=\"附圖\">－379 之值為何？【94 年第 2 次基測】","o":["1","10","<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r131.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r132.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":1,"e":"<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r133.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r134.svg\" width=\"68\" alt=\"附圖\">－379＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r135.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r136.svg\" width=\"59\" alt=\"附圖\">－379<br>＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r137.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r138.svg\" width=\"37\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r139.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">－379＝389－379＝10","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800295","s":"如圖，<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r140.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">是△ABC 的中線，H 點在<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r141.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上且<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r142.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r143.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">。若<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r144.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝12，<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r145.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝10，<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r146.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝14，連接<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r147.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，則<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r148.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝？【94 年第 2 次基測】<br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image19.png\" width=\"123\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["4","5","6","7"],"a":1,"e":"∵D 為直角△BHC 斜邊<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r150.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的中點<br>∴<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r151.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r152.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r153.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r154.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"> × 10＝5","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"難","html":1},{"id":"05800296","s":"如圖，四邊形 ABCD 是正方形，E、F 兩點分別在<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r155.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r156.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，延長<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r157.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">交直線 BC 於 G 點。若<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r158.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝12，<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r159.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝8，<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r160.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝6，則四邊形 AFGB 面積為何？【94 年第 2 次基測】<br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image20.png\" width=\"121\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["126","132","140","144"],"a":0,"e":"<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r162.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝12－8＝4<br>∵△GCE～△FDE　∴<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r163.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r164.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\"> <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r165.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"> <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r166.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r167.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"> <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r168.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"> <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r169.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3<br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r170.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝12＋3＝15，<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r171.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝12－6＝6<br>梯形 AFGB 面積＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r172.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">（6＋15）× 12＝126","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05800297","s":"如圖，四邊形 ABCD 為一菱形，M、N 兩點在<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r173.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">上，且<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r174.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝20，<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r175.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝10，<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r176.svg\" width=\"30\" alt=\"附圖\">＝18。若在菱形的四邊上找一點 O，使得∠MON 為直角，則滿足上述條件的 O 點共有幾個？【94 年第 2 次基測】<br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image21.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"189\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["2","4","6","8"],"a":1,"e":"以 <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r178.svg\" width=\"30\" alt=\"附圖\"> 為直徑作圓，與菱形 ABCD 四邊各有一個交點，將交點 O 連接 M、N 得∠MON＝90°（直徑所對的圓周角必為直角），因此滿足條件的 O 點共有 4 個","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800298","s":"大華、小明兩兄弟與父母量體重，已知母親和大華共 110 公斤，父親和小明共 120 公斤。若大華比小明重 3 公斤，則父親比母親重多少公斤？【94 年第 2 次基測】","o":["7","10","13","17"],"a":2,"e":"設小明重 x 公斤，則大華重 x＋3 公斤<br>∵母親和大華共 110 公斤<br>∴母親重 110－（x＋3）＝107－x（公斤）<br>∵父親和小明共 120 公斤<br>∴父親重 120－x（公斤）<br>則父親比母親重（120－x）－（107－x）＝13（公斤）","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800299","s":"如圖為一正六邊形 ABCDEF，P、Q 分別是<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r179.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r180.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的中點。若連接<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r181.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">，則四邊形 APQB 面積佔此正六邊形面積的幾分之幾？【94 年第 2 次基測】<br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image22.png\" width=\"121\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r183.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r184.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r185.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r186.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":0,"e":"","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800300","s":"哥哥與弟弟各有數張紀念卡。已知弟弟給哥哥 10 張後，哥哥的張數就是弟弟的 2 倍；若哥哥給弟弟 10 張，兩人的張數就一樣多。設哥哥的張數為 x 張，弟弟的張數為 y 張，依題意下列列式何者正確？【94 年第 2 次基測】","o":["<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r189.svg\" width=\"107\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r190.svg\" width=\"87\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r191.svg\" width=\"113\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r192.svg\" width=\"141\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":3,"e":"由弟弟給哥哥 10 張後，哥哥的張數就是弟弟的 2 倍，可列式：2（y－10）＝x＋10<br>由哥哥給弟弟 10 張，兩人的張數就一樣多，可列式：x－10＝y＋10","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800301","s":"若 <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r193.svg\" width=\"59\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r194.svg\" width=\"59\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r195.svg\" width=\"51\" alt=\"附圖\">＝10<sup>5</sup>，則 x－y＝？【94 年第 2 次基測】","o":["0","1","10<sup>5</sup>","1.5 × 10<sup>5</sup>"],"a":3,"e":"原式同乘以 30 得<br>5（3x－2y）＋10（2x－4y）－15（x－2y）＝30 × 10<sup>5</sup><br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r196.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"> 15x－10y＋20x－40y－15x＋30y＝30 × 10<sup>5</sup><br>20x－20y＝30 × 10<sup>5</sup>，<br>同除以 20 得 x－y＝1.5 × 10<sup>5</sup>","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800302","s":"附圖中有六件物品，顧客需任選兩件一起購買，其計價方式為：將選取的兩件物品之價格合計後，以 10 元為單位，用四捨五入法取一數值，此數值即為售價。若小明將它們作適當的組合後，可用最低價購買此六件物品，求此最低價為何？【94 年第 2 次基測】<br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image24.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"291\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["350 元","360 元","370 元","380 元"],"a":1,"e":"取 99＋55＝154 <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r198.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"> 150<br>80＋24＝104 <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r199.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"> 100<br>66＋47＝113 <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r200.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"> 110<br>因此最低價為 150＋100＋110＝360（元）","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800303","s":"附圖為一線對稱圖形，直線 PQ 為對稱軸，A、B 的對稱點分別為 C、D。若∠AOB＝90°，∠B＞∠A，且∠BOQ＞∠AOP，則關於 D 點的位置，下列敘述何者正確？【94 年第 2 次基測】<br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image25.png\" width=\"94\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["A、O、D 三點在同一直線上，且<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r202.svg\" w