lt=\"附圖\">上，<br>且 <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r228.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r229.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r230.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r231.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵∠Y＞∠X<br>∴<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r232.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r233.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\"> <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r234.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"> <img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r235.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r236.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>即 M 距離 X 點較近，距離 Y 點較遠<br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image28.png\" width=\"145\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800305","s":"小華利用自己的生日設計一個四位數的密碼，方法是：分別將月分與日期寫成兩個質數的和，再將此四個質數相乘，所得數字即為密碼（例如，生日若為 8 月 24 日，將 8 寫成 3 與 5 的和，24 寫成 11 與 13 的和，再將 3、5、11、13 相乘得密碼為 2145）。已知小華的密碼為 2030，求小華出生在幾月分？【94 年第 2 次基測】","o":["5","7","9","12"],"a":3,"e":"2030＝2 × 5 × 7 × 29<br>∵2＋29＝31 ……日<br>∴5＋7＝12 ……月<br>因此小華出生在 12 月 31 日<br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r238.svg\" width=\"113\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["94年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800306","s":"如圖，△ABC 中，∠ACB＝102°，<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r239.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r240.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r241.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r242.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，求∠ECF＝？【94 年第 2 次基測】<br><img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_image29.png\" width=\"131\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["34°","39°","45°","56°"],"a":1,"e":"∵<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r244.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r245.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　∴∠AFC＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r246.svg\" width=\"73\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r247.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r248.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　∴∠BEC＝<img src=\"img/cffd2b_y94-2_r249.svg\" width=\"72\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∠ECF＝180°－∠AFC－∠B